{
  "slug": "segmented-control",
  "name": "Segmented Control",
  "title": "分段控制器",
  "category": "base",
  "files": [
    "components/segmented-control/segmented-control.tsx"
  ],
  "description": "分段控制器：行内单选切换，选中背景在选项间平滑滑动；支持图标、纯图标选项、三种尺寸与占满宽度。",
  "keywords": [
    "segmented control",
    "toggle group",
    "switcher",
    "tabs",
    "分段控制器",
    "切换",
    "分段选择"
  ],
  "exports": [
    "SegmentedControl",
    "SegmentedControlItem"
  ],
  "demos": [
    {
      "file": "segmented-control/overview.tsx",
      "title": "概览",
      "height": 180
    },
    {
      "file": "segmented-control/icons.tsx",
      "title": "图标",
      "description": "子元素写法与 options 数据写法等价；纯图标选项需提供 aria-label。",
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "file": "segmented-control/sizes.tsx",
      "title": "尺寸与占满宽度",
      "height": 220
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "滑动指示器基于 React Aria SelectionIndicator，用纯 CSS 过渡实现，开启「减少动态效果」时直接切换。",
    "总有一项被选中（不可取消选择）；受控使用 value + onChange(value: string)。",
    "用于切换同一内容的视图或筛选条件；切换不同页面内容时请用 Tabs。"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "component": "SegmentedControl",
      "description": "其余属性透传给 React Aria ToggleButtonGroup（isDisabled、orientation 等）。",
      "props": [
        {
          "name": "options",
          "type": "SegmentedControlOption[]",
          "description": "选项数据：{ id, label?, icon?, isDisabled?, aria-label? }。"
        },
        {
          "name": "children",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "或者直接写 SegmentedControlItem。"
        },
        {
          "name": "value / defaultValue",
          "type": "string",
          "description": "受控 / 非受控的选中 id。"
        },
        {
          "name": "onChange",
          "type": "(value: string) => void",
          "description": "选中变化回调。"
        },
        {
          "name": "size",
          "type": "\"sm\" | \"md\" | \"lg\"",
          "default": "\"md\"",
          "description": "尺寸：32 / 36 / 44 px。"
        },
        {
          "name": "fullWidth",
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": "false",
          "description": "占满容器宽度，各段等宽。"
        },
        {
          "name": "aria-label",
          "type": "string",
          "description": "控件的无障碍名称。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "component": "SegmentedControlItem",
      "description": "其余属性透传给 React Aria ToggleButton。",
      "props": [
        {
          "name": "id",
          "type": "string",
          "description": "选项 id。"
        },
        {
          "name": "icon",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "图标元素。"
        },
        {
          "name": "children",
          "type": "ReactNode",
          "description": "文字。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
